  <static seed="69" source="Library/NAU/setFoundations/MAT320_0502.pg">
    <statement><p>Determine which of these relations are reflexive. The variables <m>x</m>, <m>y</m>, <m>x'</m>, <m>y'</m> represent integers.</p>
<p><var form="checkboxes">
<li>
<p><m>x \sim y</m> if and only if <m>x + y</m> is odd.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p><m>x \sim y</m> if and only if <m>x - y</m> is positive.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p><m>x \sim y</m> if and only if <m>xy \geq 0</m> .</p>
</li>
<li>
<p><m>x \sim y</m> if and only if <m>x + y</m> is even.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p><m>x \sim y</m> if and only if <m>x + y</m> is positive.</p>
</li>
</var></p>
</statement>
